<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">DATA-INFORMED COACH</view><view class="title">下一次，练得更有方向</view><view class="subtitle">{{viewer.role==='teacher'?'辅助教学建议':'个性化训练建议'}} · 先有依据，再有建议</view><demo-notice/><view class="card row"><view><view class="name">本轮关注目标</view><view class="muted">结合课堂安排选择</view></view><picker mode="selector" range="{{goals}}" bindchange="choose"><text class="pill">{{goal}} ▾</text></picker></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="refresh">{{error}} · 点击重试</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在整理数据依据…</view><block wx:if="{{advice}}"><view class="card hero"><view class="eyebrow">{{advice.scope}}</view><view class="advice-headline">{{advice.title}}</view><view class="source-tag">{{advice.source}}</view></view><view class="section">这份建议依据什么？</view><view class="card"><view class="list-row" wx:for="{{advice.evidence}}" wx:key="*this"><view class="row left"><text class="evidence-dot"/><text>{{item}}</text></view></view></view><view class="section">下一次训练的关注重点</view><view class="card"><view class="step" wx:for="{{advice.steps}}" wx:key="*this"><view class="mini muted">0{{index+1}}</view><view>{{item}}</view></view></view><view class="notice">{{advice.review}}</view><view class="section">{{viewer.role==='teacher'?'审核与教学备注':'这份建议对你有帮助吗？'}}</view><view class="card"><view class="row"><text class="name">{{viewer.role==='teacher'?'教师审核':'我的反馈'}}</text><text class="pill">{{viewer.role==='teacher'?reviewLabel:feedbackLabel}}</text></view><textarea class="feedback-note" maxlength="200" value="{{note}}" bindinput="note" placeholder="{{viewer.role==='teacher'?'记录下次课堂的指导重点（最多200字）':'记下想请教教师的问题（最多200字）'}}"/><view class="feedback-buttons" wx:if="{{viewer.role==='teacher'}}"><button class="small-btn" bindtap="save" data-value="reviewed" disabled="{{saving}}">审核留档</button><button class="small-btn" bindtap="save" data-value="needs_revision" disabled="{{saving}}">标记待修改</button></view><view class="feedback-buttons" wx:else=""><button class="small-btn" bindtap="save" data-value="helpful" disabled="{{saving}}">有帮助</button><button class="small-btn" bindtap="save" data-value="question" disabled="{{saving}}">想请教教师</button><button class="small-btn" bindtap="save" data-value="unsuitable" disabled="{{saving}}">不太适合</button></view><view wx:if="{{saving}}" class="hint">正在保存…</view><view wx:if="{{saveError}}" class="error">{{saveError}}</view><view wx:if="{{saveMessage}}" class="save-result">{{saveMessage}}</view><view class="hint">{{isDemo?'本地演示记录仅在本机保留。教师备注不会自动发给学生，学生反馈也不会自动发给教师。':'审核与反馈通过已配置的后端提交，权限由后端校验。'}}</view></view><view class="hint">建议辅助教学，不代替教师判断。外部AI服务需经后端调用，仅提交必要的去标识化统计。</view></block></view>
